<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-16T02:54:43.692Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:54:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese Armed Forces have seized Al-Khuwai in West Kordofan and are pushing toward Al-Nahud while the Rapid Support Forces continue drone strikes on civilian areas and power stations, leaving cities without electricity. Humanitarian assistance is deteriorating, with food aid cut for 900,000 people and drought and war driving Darfur and Kordofan toward famine. A Rapid Support Forces field commander has defected to the Sudanese army, a former RSF adviser was released in Chad after 13 months, and a former Sudanese information minister was attacked by armed men in Uganda. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxORHVrVmJvSHRrc0FGaVNUaFBJd2txbFV1bVdqTm9kTERkT1lXb2lxRl80YzNpUndaeDUzb1Y2V1NnU21fV2w3TmR6RkNUbVhuVnBEaFAwQnc5Ymd4VWtDczZ1emE0Y2RyRnVPblFjWXVkLWVzcTN4VFY3S3FKcWNqdDlOLWlIanRYb0c3blVvZEN5eXJWa191V2RZWUEtVTdDLWhCZ1NVQlB1ak9zM3BBTllpQ0s0QW1WbXFxMWZ3QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOWXVTdmpMaE8xQjVDejhla3FQS3JuR1NjaW1TeGswMGlvVkpwNFRMVTliLWV6TG9zWk1DN1Z0b2NSQUpwYkNfMEJ4dW9jdWJWX0JvbVp6VFI0eHZWYjNDZEJvaXZ0UURXN3lUV216aWJBeHJIelh0WEhEam9QM2cwdXB0c3BzRVhNdVR3dkxMWTMtalR3amVUNE5UMk9mbTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa Confidential&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE55QXRNdzVKbXJOeVRyX1hLWmppOE9hTmNTbm1aMmFxcWRQU3VCRHFXaXRJdG5KVTI3OE0xZUtNaE80MXI4TGFPVjE3M29INGht?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.